    "publishedDate": "2026-03-02",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Hi Kat,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your feedback. We are very sorry to hear about the disruption you experienced during your stay.\n\nThe power interruptions you described are certainly not the experience we want for our guests. While external outages are unfortunately outside of our control, we understand how frustrating this would have been - particularly with the impact on water, food storage and overall comfort. Please accept our sincere apologies for the inconvenience caused.\n\nWe are also concerned to read your comments regarding the Wi-Fi strength, TV performance and housekeeping service. Your feedback has been shared with our team so we can investigate the connectivity and ensure our televisions are functioning as expected. In addition, we have reminded our housekeeping team of the importance of consistently emptying bins and replenishing dishwasher powder and laundry liquid as part of each scheduled service.\n\nWe really appreciate you bringing these matters to our attention, as it allows us to review and improve. Should you choose to stay with us again, please don’t hesitate to contact reception during your stay so we can address any concerns promptly.\n\nWarm regards,\nLisa, Quest Midland",
    "username": "Quest Midland",
    "connectionToSubject": "Owner",
    "userProfile": {
      "avatar": null
    }
  },
