  "title": "Not the best time",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Power went out multiple times which made us have to stay inside, stuck without water and food. Wifi signal was weak, TV’s weren’t great, room cleaning service wasn’t the best, they didn’t empty the bins every time nor did they give us cleaning supplies every time like the dishwasher powder / clothes washing liquid",
