    "publishedDate": "2026-02-22",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Hi Chipo,\n\nThank you so much for your thoughtful review and for giving us the opportunity to welcome you back to Quest Midland.\n\nWe’re really pleased to hear that your recent stay was such a positive one and that our team made you feel warmly welcomed, with a smooth and easy check-in experience. It means a lot to know that this visit helped change your perspective, and we’re grateful that you chose to stay with us again.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back again soon!\n\nWarm regards,\nLisa, Quest Midland",
