  "text": "I had a wonderful stay at Quest Midland. The staff were warm and friendly, and the check-in process was quick and easy.\nThis visit was such a big improvement from my previous experience in 2025. My stay this time truly changed my perspective, and I’m very grateful for the positive experience.\nA special thank you to Lisa for making the booking process so smooth and stress-free.\n",
