    "translationType": null,
    "publishedDate": "2026-02-22",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Thank you so much for your lovely review and for choosing to stay with us at Quest Midland.\n\nIt’s wonderful to hear that our team were helpful, friendly and a pleasure to deal with throughout your stay. Providing courteous and attentive service is something we’re really proud of, and your kind words will mean a lot to the team.\n\nWe really appreciate your support and look forward to welcoming you back again soon.\n\nWarm regards,\nLisa, Quest Midland",
