    "publishedDate": "2026-02-12",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Hi Matt,\n\nThank you for sharing your feedback.\n\nWe’re really sorry for the confusion around the booking dates and the inconvenience this caused on arrival. We understand how stressful it is to arrive and not have your accommodation ready as expected, and we appreciate how frustrating that must have felt.\n\nAs mentioned in our private correspondence, we’ve since reviewed what occurred with the booking details and purchase order so we can prevent this from happening again in future. Clear communication is really important to us, and we’re always looking at ways to improve our processes for both guests and travel bookers.\n\nThank you for taking the time to speak with us directly, and we hope we have the opportunity to welcome you back for a much smoother stay next time.\n\nWarm regards,\nLisa, Quest Midland",
    "username": "Quest Midland",
    "connectionToSubject": "Owner",
    "userProfile": {
      "avatar": null
    }
  },
