    "text": "Thank you so much for your lovely review and for sharing your experience with us!\n\nIt’s really pleasing to hear that our team made such a positive impression. We’re so proud of how polite, friendly and welcoming they are, and your kind words mean a lot to all of us. Knowing you couldn’t fault the facilities and enjoyed our convenient location close to great local spots for food, drinks and essentials makes it even better.\n\nWe really appreciate you choosing to stay with us and are so glad you’d return. We look forward to welcoming you back again soon for another comfortable stay.\n\nWarm regards,\nLisa, Quest Midland",
